	Two nights becomes a question mark. Neither of you says so out loud; you just start asking questions, and Maraya -- suspicious, layered Maraya -- begins answering them twice, once out loud, once underneath.
<<else>>
	The city watches you work. You can feel it doing arithmetic.
<</if>>

